    "contractCount",
    "contractedTonnes",
    "contractValue",
    "unpricedCount"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": {},
  "description": "One currency slice of the contract book. Buckets are NEVER summed across currencies — 100k EUR plus 100k USD is not 200k of anything — and a contract priced without a currency gets its own bucket rather than joining a neighbour. Sorted by descending value, with the no-currency bucket last."
}"
`;

