    "tileUrl"
  ],
  "description": "A satellite-index overlay source. configured:false means no Earth-Engine credentials on this deployment; configured:true with an EMPTY tileUrl means there is nothing to show (no field geometry, or a transient failure named in error) and the overlay should simply stay off. \`date\` is the imagery’s real acquisition date and can be older than the date requested, because the composite falls back to the latest available window."
}"
`;

