      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "**\`false\` is a real and expected outcome of a 201.** The invite row is committed before the mail is attempted and a mailer failure never fails creation, so a \`201 { emailSent: false }\` means \\"the invite exists, nobody was told\\" — show the admin \`url\` to pass on by hand."
    }
  },
