          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "name",
    "geometry"
  ],
  "description": "Hand-drawn parcel. \`geometry\` is a GeoJSON Polygon or MultiPolygon in WGS84; rings need ≥4 positions and lon/lat must be in range. A self-intersecting shape is a 400 — PostGIS is the final arbiter, this only catches the common cases early."
}"
`;

