        "array",
        "null"
      ],
      "items": {
        "type": "number"
      },
      "minItems": 4,
      "maxItems": 4,
      "description": "Bounding box as \`[west, south, east, north]\` — \`[minLon, minLat, maxLon, maxLat]\`, **longitude first**, per GeoJSON and the reverse of the \`lat, lon\` a human quotes. WGS84 degrees, exactly four numbers. Null when the import produced no bounded geometry."
    },
