    "flagged",
    "bounds",
    "jobRunId"
  ],
  "description": "The \`details\` payload of a completed \`spatial-import\` job. parcelCount is matched + created — what the file contained. flagged counts existing parcels the file omitted, which were kept rather than deleted, so it is deliberately NOT part of parcelCount."
}"
`;

